44 contacts are isolated to stop Nigeria's first Ebola case in over a decade from spreading. This is Omni View Top World News, Episode 30. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. After that, damage tankers in the Strait of Hormuz, missiles on Keeve, and a measles death the health agency will not place, then a California tax argued from each direction and one measured recovery. Nigeria's health minister, Muhammad Ali Pot, tells the BBC the patient is a 42-year-old

